@url = http://localhost:8080/api/reviews
@token = paste-jwt-token-here

### Add a review for a library entry

POST {{url}} HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userGameId": 1,
  "body": "A thoughtful puzzle game with excellent level design."
}

### Update a review

PUT {{url}}/1 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "body": "Still one of my favorite puzzle games."
}

### Delete a review

DELETE {{url}}/1 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
